 "subs": [
  {
   "t": 0.15,
   "until": 3.627,
   "text": "Most local businesses don't have a proper website."
  },
  {
   "t": 3.377,
   "until": 8.144,
   "text": "Some have none, some have a broken one, and some are invisible online."
  },
  {
   "t": 10.394,
   "until": 12.701,
   "text": "Each one is a potential client."
  },
  {
   "t": 12.451,
   "until": 17.279,
   "text": "So at TechnoTribes, we built Lead Finder, to find them automatically."
  },
  {
   "t": 18.329,
   "until": 19.773,
   "text": "Here's a quick tour."
  },
  {
   "t": 22.323,
   "until": 26.446,
   "text": "Your team signs in with Google, and lands on the Overview:"
  },
  {
   "t": 26.196,
   "until": 29.251,
   "text": "a live summary of every lead found so far."
  },
  {
   "t": 30.301,
   "until": 33.366,
   "text": "One hundred and sixty six leads this week."
  },
  {
   "t": 33.116,
   "until": 39.063,
   "text": "Ninety six with no website, twenty nine with a bad one, and forty one with low reach."
  },
  {
   "t": 40.113,
   "until": 45.653,
   "text": "Twenty nine already have an email, and the whole month of searching cost under three dollars."
  },
  {
   "t": 46.703,
   "until": 52.351,
   "text": "Charts show where the leads are, which kinds of business they are, and how your pipeline is moving."
  },
  {
   "t": 54.901,
   "until": 62.105,
   "text": "On the Leads page, every row is a real local business, with its rating, location and contact details."
  },
  {
   "t": 63.155,
   "until": 66.198,
   "text": "And it tells you exactly why it's a lead."
  },
  {
   "t": 65.948,
   "until": 68.854,
   "text": "A free Square page and no real website."
  },
  {
   "t": 68.604,
   "until": 70.148,
   "text": "A site that's down."
  },
  {
   "t": 69.898,
   "until": 72.6,
   "text": "Or a good site with only one review."
  },
  {
   "t": 73.65,
   "until": 80.193,
   "text": "Filter by country, city, category, rating or status, and export to CSV in one click."
  },
  {
   "t": 82.743,
   "until": 85.21,
   "text": "Open any lead for the full picture."
  },
  {
   "t": 84.96,
   "until": 90.972,
   "text": "This barber shop has four point eight stars from over five hundred reviews, but no website."
  },
  {
   "t": 92.022,
   "until": 95.737,
   "text": "It gets a priority score, so you know who to call first."
  },
  {
   "t": 95.487,
   "until": 100.933,
   "text": "Lead Finder also checks the website's speed and problems, so you know what to pitch."
  },
  {
   "t": 101.983,
   "until": 104.127,
   "text": "Here's another kind of lead:"
  },
  {
   "t": 103.877,
   "until": 108.997,
   "text": "a handyman with a good website, but only one review and no social media."
  },
  {
   "t": 108.747,
   "until": 111.364,
   "text": "A perfect fit for a growth package."
  },
  {
   "t": 112.414,
   "until": 113.525,
   "text": "Then track it:"
  },
  {
   "t": 113.275,
   "until": 116.291,
   "text": "set a status, assign an owner, and add notes."
  },
  {
   "t": 118.841,
   "until": 120.969,
   "text": "New leads come from searches."
  },
  {
   "t": 120.719,
   "until": 123.948,
   "text": "Pick a country, a city and a type of business."
  },
  {
   "t": 123.698,
   "until": 126.344,
   "text": "Each search costs about twelve cents."
  },
  {
   "t": 127.394,
   "until": 128.83,
   "text": "Every run is logged:"
  },
  {
   "t": 128.58,
   "until": 133.575,
   "text": "what it searched, how many places it found, how many were new, and what it cost."
  },
  {
   "t": 134.625,
   "until": 140.035,
   "text": "And a nightly queue runs saved searches automatically, within your monthly budget."
  },
  {
   "t": 139.785,
   "until": 142.427,
   "text": "So fresh leads arrive while you sleep."
  },
  {
   "t": 144.977,
   "until": 149.749,
   "text": "Admins control exactly who can sign in, with a role for each person."
  },
  {
   "t": 150.799,
   "until": 155.38,
   "text": "And a suppressed list keeps businesses you never want to see out of your results."
  },
  {
   "t": 156.43,
   "until": 163.379,
   "text": "Lead Finder finds the businesses that need you, explains why, and keeps your pipeline full, automatically."
  },
  {
   "t": 164.429,
   "until": 167.51,
   "text": "Want a lead engine like this for your business?"
  },
  {
   "t": 167.26,
   "until": 168.775,
   "text": "Talk to TechnoTribes."
  }
 ]
}